# 1. PURPOSE

This document defines the official long-term execution roadmap for Trady AI.

Its purpose is to:

* preserve lifecycle sequencing
* prevent architectural drift
* maintain deterministic-first execution
* preserve bounded implementation
* coordinate long-term system evolution
* externalize operational continuity
* prevent premature complexity inflation
* separate experimentation from stable baselines

This roadmap defines:

* official project phases
* lifecycle objectives
* implementation sequencing
* freeze boundaries
* architectural progression
* stabilization milestones
* long-term infrastructure direction

This roadmap is operational authority for project progression.

